Working Directory
        ↓
    git add
        ↓
  Staging Area
        ↓
   git commit
        ↓
Local Repository
        ↓
    git push
        ↓
Remote Repository / GitHub

When you want the latest code:

git pull

When you want to download an existing project for the first time:

